      "text": "Repository development practice: tests run from repo root with npm test using Vitest, which auto-loads root .env (missing keys skip; live quota soft-skips); unit and live provider test commands are documented, with live tests gated by RUN_LIVE_PROVIDER_TESTS / RUN_LOCAL_PROVIDER_TESTS env vars."
